    <h2>Finding Your Nearest Store on the Official Website</h2>
    <p>Since individual franchise owners independently manage their store's operating hours, drive-thru availability, and holiday schedules, we highly recommend verifying details using the official store finder before you head out: <a href="https://www.dairyqueen.com/en-us/locator/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">dairyqueen.com/en-us/locator/</a>.</p>
    <p>For added convenience, consider downloading the official DQ mobile app on iOS or Android. It allows you to place mobile orders in advance and earn valuable DQ Rewards points on qualifying treats and food.</p>

    <h2>Dairy Queen Treat (Locations &amp; Menu) vs. DQ Grill &amp; Chill</h2>
    <p>Before you hit the road, it's crucial to distinguish between a <strong>Dairy Queen Treat (locations &amp; menu)</strong> and a full-service DQ Grill &amp; Chill so you aren't surprised by the menu offerings when you arrive:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Dairy Queen Treat (Locations &amp; Menu)</strong>: Often found nestled within shopping malls, airport concourses, lifestyle centers, and travel plazas, DQ Treat locations are dedicated exclusively to desserts. Their menu highlights the complete selection of Blizzard® Treats, classic soft-serve cones, sundaes, Royal treats, novelty favorites like Dilly Bars, shakes, and customizable ice cream cakes. Keep in mind, they typically do not serve hot food items like Stackburgers or Chicken Strip Baskets.</li>
      <li><strong>DQ Grill &amp; Chill® Locations</strong>: These are the comprehensive, standalone restaurants that offer the best of both worlds. They feature a full hot food menu—including Stackburgers, golden chicken baskets, cheese curds, fries, and even breakfast at specific locations—alongside the entire array of famous soft-serve treats.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Highest State Concentrations</h2>
    <p>Dairy Queen's footprint is deeply embedded in the Midwest and the South. Texas proudly leads the pack with over 600 locations, followed tightly by Minnesota (the birthplace of DQ's corporate headquarters), Ohio, Illinois, and Missouri. In fact, Texas restaurants even boast an exclusive "Texas Country Foods" menu, highlighting regional favorites like the iconic Dude® chicken-fried steak sandwich and crispy jalapeño strips.</p>

    <h2>International Presence</h2>
    <p>On a global scale, Dairy Queen operates successfully in over 20 countries, including Canada, China, Saudi Arabia, the UAE, Thailand, and South Korea. Many of these international branches put unique local spins on the classic Blizzard, introducing flavors like green tea, durian, or mango to cater beautifully to regional tastes.</p>

